    "sentence_translations": [
      "You Should Rest A Bit",
      "",
      "Lili got a fever, and her entire body was feverish.",
      "Lili's boyfriend Little He went out to buy medicine for Lili, and after he got back he kept holding her hand.",
      "",
      "Lili was moved. She tried to pull away her hand, saying:",
      "“Darling, you must be tired. You don't have to keep me company. Get some rest!”",
      "",
      "Little He pulled her hand back and said:",
      "“It's nothing. It was really cold when I went to buy medicine now, so I want to warm up by holding your hand.”"
    ]
